(5695433, 828719, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good Triptych layout. You gave an absolutely unappealing subject some interest. Your triptych tells a story. The title is a bit of a mystery...</td>', 'Good Triptych layout. You gave an absolutely unappealing subject some interest. Your triptych tells a story. The title is a bit of a mystery...', '2009-10-21 11:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
