(5695448, 828661, 43463, '<td valign="top">The color is stunning. Absolutely wonderful golden hues in this photo composition. Love the details in the foliage in the up close shots and the middle shot just completes the beauty. A crisp, cold, gorgeous golden day spent relaxing at the lake watching the ducks while bundled up nice &amp; warm in a jacket.</td>', 'The color is stunning. Absolutely wonderful golden hues in this photo composition. Love the details in the foliage in the up close shots and the middle shot just completes the beauty. A crisp, cold, gorgeous golden day spent relaxing at the lake watching the ducks while bundled up nice & warm in a jacket.', '2009-10-21 12:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5695454, 828681, 43463, '<td valign="top">The details of this marble on the surface of water are wonderful. Love the color hues of serene blues and purples. Beautifully done.</td>', 'The details of this marble on the surface of water are wonderful. Love the color hues of serene blues and purples. Beautifully done.', '2009-10-21 12:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5695457, 828384, 43463, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love the trio in this composition! Love the how the light plays on the grapes and illuminates those lovely purple hues. I also love how the bokeh in that shot with the ''circles'' in the backdrop complementing the circular shape of the grapes. Love the texture and details that you show us in the grape leaves in the top right photo. And the cherry on the top, is when you pull back from the close-ups to show us the full scale beauty of the vineyards. The rolling grapevines that line the valley, the mountains in the distance, and the added bonus of the hot air balloons rising just makes this triptych a stunning beauty to look upon.</td>', 'Absolutely love the trio in this composition! Love the how the light plays on the grapes and illuminates those lovely purple hues. I also love how the bokeh in that shot with the ''circles'' in the backdrop complementing the circular shape of the grapes. Love the texture and details that you show us in the grape leaves in the top right photo. And the cherry on the top, is when you pull back from the close-ups to show us the full scale beauty of the vineyards. The rolling grapevines that line the valley, the mountains in the distance, and the added bonus of the hot air balloons rising just makes this triptych a stunning beauty to look upon.', '2009-10-21 12:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5695461, 828786, 43463, '<td valign="top">The details these head shots of these owls is absolutely stunning! In some areas I can actually count the fine filiments/hairs of the feathers. Those eyes just stare out and grab hold of you. I also love how you arranged your triptych of these owls vertically - it brings to mind the totem poles of the pacific northwest. Lighting is absolutely wonderful fully illuminating all three faces of these nocturnal birds.</td>', 'The details these head shots of these owls is absolutely stunning! In some areas I can actually count the fine filiments/hairs of the feathers. Those eyes just stare out and grab hold of you. I also love how you arranged your triptych of these owls vertically - it brings to mind the totem poles of the pacific northwest. Lighting is absolutely wonderful fully illuminating all three faces of these nocturnal birds.', '2009-10-21 12:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
