(5695572, 828717, 108580, '<td valign="top">Technically impressive and a well orchestrated shot. The choc Oreo (?) is also detailed and that makes it much more difficult to get white cup/milk and dark biscuit exposed right with enough detail. Milk splashes are perfect, hooray for fast FPS camera''s! I hope you did this in M mode and not A mode as I''d like to know how it was done! The framing is incredibly original and unusual. A masterpiece for Basic Editing. Hardwork has it''s rewards...</td>', 'Technically impressive and a well orchestrated shot. The choc Oreo (?) is also detailed and that makes it much more difficult to get white cup/milk and dark biscuit exposed right with enough detail. Milk splashes are perfect, hooray for fast FPS camera''s! I hope you did this in M mode and not A mode as I''d like to know how it was done! The framing is incredibly original and unusual. A masterpiece for Basic Editing. Hardwork has it''s rewards...', '2009-10-21 13:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
