(5696267, 828158, 77196, '<td valign="top">Cute. The Froggy Family, with a stack o'' kids in the middle. Nice lighting, colors and composition. IMO, right pane is a shade too green.</td>', 'Cute. The Froggy Family, with a stack o'' kids in the middle. Nice lighting, colors and composition. IMO, right pane is a shade too green.', '2009-10-21 20:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696268, 828492, 73056, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2009-10-21 20:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696269, 828492, 77196, '<td valign="top">Spectacular! Love the ripples on the water, the faint color in some of the trees, and the skys.</td>', 'Spectacular! Love the ripples on the water, the faint color in some of the trees, and the skys.', '2009-10-21 20:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696271, 828356, 73056, '<td valign="top">Great action shots!</td>', 'Great action shots!', '2009-10-21 20:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696274, 828521, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot of the mountains. IMO, the shots are too similar - basically three bands of roughly the same coloration side to side. Also, the road through the center of the bottom pane is very distracting.</td>', 'Very nice shot of the mountains. IMO, the shots are too similar - basically three bands of roughly the same coloration side to side. Also, the road through the center of the bottom pane is very distracting.', '2009-10-21 20:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696277, 828193, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting find. Something a bit too wall-mounted straight-on perspective about this. Perhaps a perspective closer to the base of the numbers to give it a feel of motion (aided by the arrows).</td>', 'Interesting find. Something a bit too wall-mounted straight-on perspective about this. Perhaps a perspective closer to the base of the numbers to give it a feel of motion (aided by the arrows).', '2009-10-21 20:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696279, 828382, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. I find it quite "artsy" with the tarnished cup upside down, bottle in the center pane, and shiny cup right side up at the right - gives a progression to lead you through the panes. Somehow it feels to me like the bottle top chopped off is a problem - bothers me for some reason. Nice to offset the bottle from dead center, though.</td>', 'Very interesting shot. I find it quite "artsy" with the tarnished cup upside down, bottle in the center pane, and shiny cup right side up at the right - gives a progression to lead you through the panes. Somehow it feels to me like the bottle top chopped off is a problem - bothers me for some reason. Nice to offset the bottle from dead center, though.', '2009-10-21 20:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696282, 828740, 106233, '<td valign="top">Great idea! If possible, maybe i would choose one water transportation to cover earh, water and sky, but i think you did great. The only thing that bothers me is the red trails that begin in the middle of the road, on the automobiles pic... maybe this is not a big deal...</td>', 'Great idea! If possible, maybe i would choose one water transportation to cover earh, water and sky, but i think you did great. The only thing that bothers me is the red trails that begin in the middle of the road, on the automobiles pic... maybe this is not a big deal...', '2009-10-21 20:16:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696284, 828663, 106233, '<td valign="top">I really like the sharpness and colors of your pictures, but i think that would be better if you mixed different framings of the owl, maybe putting one of the pictures on a less tight perspective.</td>', 'I really like the sharpness and colors of your pictures, but i think that would be better if you mixed different framings of the owl, maybe putting one of the pictures on a less tight perspective.', '2009-10-21 20:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696287, 827994, 106233, '<td valign="top">GREAT idea!! I also like the BW choice!! Congratulations! The best until now, IMO!</td>', 'GREAT idea!! I also like the BW choice!! Congratulations! The best until now, IMO!', '2009-10-21 20:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696288, 828731, 76598, '<td valign="top">What an incredible sequence and perfect for this challenge....congratulations.</td>', 'What an incredible sequence and perfect for this challenge....congratulations.', '2009-10-21 20:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696290, 828821, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. IMO, the left pane is a bit out of synch with the other two - flower appears closer, larger. It having water drops on it where the other two either don''t (or nor obviously so) also bothers my sense of "flow". Maybe part of it is lighting - right two panes are lit from the front, but the left pane appears to be lit from behind &amp; to the right, putting the near / left side of the flower in shadow (dark). Regardless, this still has a compelling feel to it.</td>', 'Nice idea. IMO, the left pane is a bit out of synch with the other two - flower appears closer, larger. It having water drops on it where the other two either don''t (or nor obviously so) also bothers my sense of "flow". Maybe part of it is lighting - right two panes are lit from the front, but the left pane appears to be lit from behind & to the right, putting the near / left side of the flower in shadow (dark). Regardless, this still has a compelling feel to it.', '2009-10-21 20:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696291, 828158, 76598, '<td valign="top">beautiful entry, great composition, the color tone is great as well.</td>', 'beautiful entry, great composition, the color tone is great as well.', '2009-10-21 20:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696292, 828053, 76598, '<td valign="top">I can''t give you a score for laughing</td>', 'I can''t give you a score for laughing', '2009-10-21 20:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696294, 828820, 76598, '<td valign="top">Love the tone of this and the different perspectives on the deer and squirrel are very nice....great job</td>', 'Love the tone of this and the different perspectives on the deer and squirrel are very nice....great job', '2009-10-21 20:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696295, 828792, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very nice sequence, colors are good, wish the hot spots on the pepper weren''t quite so hot.....but you got a good score from me.</td>', 'Very nice sequence, colors are good, wish the hot spots on the pepper weren''t quite so hot.....but you got a good score from me.', '2009-10-21 20:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696296, 828681, 76598, '<td valign="top">Same image tweaked?  Even if it is, it works very well....excellent submission.</td>', 'Same image tweaked?  Even if it is, it works very well....excellent submission.', '2009-10-21 20:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696297, 828045, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture, your camera had to be howling to catch this.</td>', 'Very nice capture, your camera had to be howling to catch this.', '2009-10-21 20:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696298, 828280, 76598, '<td valign="top">the color intensity is what makes this work, I like the different angles.</td>', 'the color intensity is what makes this work, I like the different angles.', '2009-10-21 20:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696299, 828079, 76598, '<td valign="top">The doors almost blend together and you can''t tell where the breaks are...that could be bad or good...I am still agonizing over it.  Really nice job.</td>', 'The doors almost blend together and you can''t tell where the breaks are...that could be bad or good...I am still agonizing over it.  Really nice job.', '2009-10-21 20:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696300, 828445, 76598, '<td valign="top">Nice play with the lighting.  Did you use all your pixels?  It strikes me as small.</td>', 'Nice play with the lighting.  Did you use all your pixels?  It strikes me as small.', '2009-10-21 20:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696301, 828483, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Even lighting, some added grain. Nice arrangement, and putting Royal and the chrome strip at an angle adds interest and relief from the otherwise almost exclusive vertical / horizontal lines.</td>', 'Nicely done. Even lighting, some added grain. Nice arrangement, and putting Royal and the chrome strip at an angle adds interest and relief from the otherwise almost exclusive vertical / horizontal lines.', '2009-10-21 20:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696302, 828343, 76598, '<td valign="top">I like the angles and the tone is good.  I think a larger line between the three parts might have added to the image.</td>', 'I like the angles and the tone is good.  I think a larger line between the three parts might have added to the image.', '2009-10-21 20:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696303, 828441, 76598, '<td valign="top">The light on this is excellent, the color tone and your choice of separation lines work well as well, great entry</td>', 'The light on this is excellent, the color tone and your choice of separation lines work well as well, great entry', '2009-10-21 20:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696304, 828824, 76598, '<td valign="top">Love the sequence, I have given you a good score, it does strike me as being a little flat.</td>', 'Love the sequence, I have given you a good score, it does strike me as being a little flat.', '2009-10-21 20:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696306, 828406, 76598, '<td valign="top">I look forward to a set like this with grandchildren, which I don''t have yet.  Just really cute.</td>', 'I look forward to a set like this with grandchildren, which I don''t have yet.  Just really cute.', '2009-10-21 20:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696309, 827799, 76598, '<td valign="top">The background should have been blue, because I suspect he was cold to be sitting like this for you to take these pictures.  Just an excellent entry, great color, focus and tone.   This would normally do incredibly well, but this is a tough group of entries.</td>', 'The background should have been blue, because I suspect he was cold to be sitting like this for you to take these pictures.  Just an excellent entry, great color, focus and tone.   This would normally do incredibly well, but this is a tough group of entries.', '2009-10-21 20:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696310, 828628, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like the unorthodox divisions of the panes. You''ve done a very good job of continuity and motion through the panes. The counterclockwise motion of the ball path is opposite of what Western culture expects to see - not sure if that is a deliberate distraction. IMO, this could have been a bit brighter / well lit overall - the top is almost too dark.</td>', 'I like the unorthodox divisions of the panes. You''ve done a very good job of continuity and motion through the panes. The counterclockwise motion of the ball path is opposite of what Western culture expects to see - not sure if that is a deliberate distraction. IMO, this could have been a bit brighter / well lit overall - the top is almost too dark.', '2009-10-21 20:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696316, 828745, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very well done. Love the monochrome to color - blank to smile transition. The "humanization" of the grim cowboy. Great job of keeping background almost uniform, and definitely in a non-distracting role.</td>', 'Very well done. Love the monochrome to color - blank to smile transition. The "humanization" of the grim cowboy. Great job of keeping background almost uniform, and definitely in a non-distracting role.', '2009-10-21 20:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696320, 828102, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wow. Excellent job of keeping images with similar lighting, similar backgrounds, placement. Great concept. Very, very nice. I could see this framed and hanging in their home.</td>', 'Wow. Excellent job of keeping images with similar lighting, similar backgrounds, placement. Great concept. Very, very nice. I could see this framed and hanging in their home.', '2009-10-21 20:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696321, 828461, 76598, '<td valign="top">Nice mixture of water falls and well composed.  Each image stands alone and makes a good pairing as a whole</td>', 'Nice mixture of water falls and well composed.  Each image stands alone and makes a good pairing as a whole', '2009-10-21 20:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696324, 828452, 76598, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on this.  One image separated or three exposures?  Colors are very nice and well composed.</td>', 'Interesting take on this.  One image separated or three exposures?  Colors are very nice and well composed.', '2009-10-21 20:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696326, 828425, 76598, '<td valign="top">nice collection of images in the triplet, well exposed and colorful, nice use of the vase.</td>', 'nice collection of images in the triplet, well exposed and colorful, nice use of the vase.', '2009-10-21 20:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696327, 828825, 77196, '<td valign="top">Is it always that obvious? Nice captures. Nice job of similar lighting, and continuity between panes.</td>', 'Is it always that obvious? Nice captures. Nice job of similar lighting, and continuity between panes.', '2009-10-21 20:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696329, 828511, 76598, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, the lines set it off well and compliment the images.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, the lines set it off well and compliment the images.', '2009-10-21 20:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696331, 828277, 76598, '<td valign="top">excellent use of several macros to build one image.</td>', 'excellent use of several macros to build one image.', '2009-10-21 20:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696333, 828683, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Different, but it works well.</td>', 'Interesting. Different, but it works well.', '2009-10-21 20:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696337, 828708, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting - not much in focus, but it conveys the concepts pleasingly and well. Probably least recognizable is his hand washing his head. Each of these shots could stand on its own, but combined they have even more impact.</td>', 'Interesting - not much in focus, but it conveys the concepts pleasingly and well. Probably least recognizable is his hand washing his head. Each of these shots could stand on its own, but combined they have even more impact.', '2009-10-21 20:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696349, 828792, 37845, '<td valign="top">This would make an excellent stock photo image for hot peppers.</td>', 'This would make an excellent stock photo image for hot peppers.', '2009-10-21 20:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696350, 827950, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice even lighting and composition. Not sure what the hand positions mean, so I''m left with three pictures of hand positions and not much meaning. Overall the feeling is dark and distant (the background face, looking like it is holding back intentionally).</td>', 'Nice even lighting and composition. Not sure what the hand positions mean, so I''m left with three pictures of hand positions and not much meaning. Overall the feeling is dark and distant (the background face, looking like it is holding back intentionally).', '2009-10-21 20:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696352, 827981, 37845, '<td valign="top">I like that you chose different zooms for this.</td>', 'I like that you chose different zooms for this.', '2009-10-21 20:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696353, 828406, 106233, '<td valign="top">Great expressions!! Maybe would be better if one of the pictures is on a less tight framing...</td>', 'Great expressions!! Maybe would be better if one of the pictures is on a less tight framing...', '2009-10-21 20:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696354, 827798, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of blue tones. Nice even lighting and composition. Great model.</td>', 'Interesting use of blue tones. Nice even lighting and composition. Great model.', '2009-10-21 20:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696355, 828720, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great! I love the continuity between the mountains, shore, and boat. A bit bluish cast, but the overall impression is of somewhere I''d love to visit.</td>', 'Great! I love the continuity between the mountains, shore, and boat. A bit bluish cast, but the overall impression is of somewhere I''d love to visit.', '2009-10-21 20:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696356, 828816, 37845, '<td valign="top">Whoa, thats really cool. I like the unconventional choice of triptych, and the alternating colour and desat. Well done.</td>', 'Whoa, thats really cool. I like the unconventional choice of triptych, and the alternating colour and desat. Well done.', '2009-10-21 20:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696358, 828632, 37845, '<td valign="top">This is like a persons conscience, with a little devil on one shoulder and a little angel on the other. Nicely captured.</td>', 'This is like a persons conscience, with a little devil on one shoulder and a little angel on the other. Nicely captured.', '2009-10-21 20:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696360, 828813, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of black and white backgrounds. Not sure I''d have had the smaller poses oriented to the edges of the image, rather than towards the central subject. Normally arrangements like this leave a too large gap in the lower sides of the main image, but you''ve avoided that nicely.</td>', 'Interesting use of black and white backgrounds. Not sure I''d have had the smaller poses oriented to the edges of the image, rather than towards the central subject. Normally arrangements like this leave a too large gap in the lower sides of the main image, but you''ve avoided that nicely.', '2009-10-21 20:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696361, 828280, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice color, lighting, and patterns.</td>', 'Nice color, lighting, and patterns.', '2009-10-21 20:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696362, 828631, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice pictures and balance. Interesting progression in "size" of main objects in each pane left-to-right. Makes the lamp at left seem large. Very nice fireworks shot.</td>', 'Very nice pictures and balance. Interesting progression in "size" of main objects in each pane left-to-right. Makes the lamp at left seem large. Very nice fireworks shot.', '2009-10-21 20:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696364, 828343, 77196, '<td valign="top">Lots of lines and angles - so much so that it almost hides the division between the panes. Nice detail and muted colors.</td>', 'Lots of lines and angles - so much so that it almost hides the division between the panes. Nice detail and muted colors.', '2009-10-21 20:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696366, 828771, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice shots - great detail. You''ve done a nice job in conveying the horse turning itself towards you.</td>', 'Very nice shots - great detail. You''ve done a nice job in conveying the horse turning itself towards you.', '2009-10-21 20:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696369, 828744, 37845, '<td valign="top">The chin looks like <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=28742" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Art Roflmao</a>, but I promise not to let that affect my vote ;)<br/> <br/>Honestly though, this is a great shot that shows the resemblance (I am assuming the boys are family). Excellent generational shot.</td>', 'The chin looks like  Art Roflmao, but I promise not to let that affect my vote ;) Honestly though, this is a great shot that shows the resemblance (I am assuming the boys are family). Excellent generational shot.', '2009-10-21 20:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696370, 827994, 37845, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome photo.... made me howl out laughing. An instant classic.</td>', 'This is an awesome photo.... made me howl out laughing. An instant classic.', '2009-10-21 20:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696372, 827919, 37845, '<td valign="top">Among the best shots in this challenge... I fully expect to see this in the top 10, if not the ribbons.</td>', 'Among the best shots in this challenge... I fully expect to see this in the top 10, if not the ribbons.', '2009-10-21 20:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696386, 828747, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice fall scenes. Nicely uniform brightness. Nice colors. IMO the bottom right frame detracts badly from an otherwise nice shot. It has a shallow DOF - the other two panes are deep DOF. Worse, the focus of the shallow DOF - the yellow leaf is overexposed, losing almost all detail and becoming a yellow blob at the visual focal point of that pane. In fact, it is so overpowering that it almost become the focal of the whole image. The nice detail in the wood of the stump helps pull it back a bit. <br/>The fence in the bottom right pane is a very nice leading line, drawing your attention to the upper pane.</td>', 'Nice fall scenes. Nicely uniform brightness. Nice colors. IMO the bottom right frame detracts badly from an otherwise nice shot. It has a shallow DOF - the other two panes are deep DOF. Worse, the focus of the shallow DOF - the yellow leaf is overexposed, losing almost all detail and becoming a yellow blob at the visual focal point of that pane. In fact, it is so overpowering that it almost become the focal of the whole image. The nice detail in the wood of the stump helps pull it back a bit. The fence in the bottom right pane is a very nice leading line, drawing your attention to the upper pane.', '2009-10-21 21:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696387, 828834, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of differing backgrounds for the color and variation in this image. Nice, even lighting on the eggs, and good job of avoiding "hot spots". A colorful, pleasing image.</td>', 'Interesting use of differing backgrounds for the color and variation in this image. Nice, even lighting on the eggs, and good job of avoiding "hot spots". A colorful, pleasing image.', '2009-10-21 21:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696389, 827803, 77196, '<td valign="top">Is that like C for cat? This seems upside down to me. Nice kitty pics and interesting crops and orientations for each pane.</td>', 'Is that like C for cat? This seems upside down to me. Nice kitty pics and interesting crops and orientations for each pane.', '2009-10-21 21:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696390, 828384, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice image. IMO, the grapes need to be a bit brighter to form a better match with the back lit leaf. The bright colors in the hot air balloons add a nice touch.</td>', 'Very, very nice image. IMO, the grapes need to be a bit brighter to form a better match with the back lit leaf. The bright colors in the hot air balloons add a nice touch.', '2009-10-21 21:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696392, 828638, 77196, '<td valign="top">I have found Jellys very hard to shoot well, and all three of these are very nice. IMO, your border is a tad too wide top &amp; bottom and the wide white detracts from the very nice aqua, blue, black colors in the panes.</td>', 'I have found Jellys very hard to shoot well, and all three of these are very nice. IMO, your border is a tad too wide top & bottom and the wide white detracts from the very nice aqua, blue, black colors in the panes.', '2009-10-21 21:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696396, 828347, 77196, '<td valign="top">Birdie not a favorite, eh? I like how this tells a story. Took me a bit to figure out what was going on, and then a bit longer to see the parrot in the upper left pane. Makes me feel a bit intrusive, seeing the boy''s obvious fear and discomfort.</td>', 'Birdie not a favorite, eh? I like how this tells a story. Took me a bit to figure out what was going on, and then a bit longer to see the parrot in the upper left pane. Makes me feel a bit intrusive, seeing the boy''s obvious fear and discomfort.', '2009-10-21 21:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696397, 827844, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of motion, and transition from standing to flying. Maybe a bit too blue on the cast.</td>', 'Nice sense of motion, and transition from standing to flying. Maybe a bit too blue on the cast.', '2009-10-21 21:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696400, 828280, 63269, '<td valign="top">Personally I wish the image on the left matched the ones on the right a little more... those are beautiful!</td>', 'Personally I wish the image on the left matched the ones on the right a little more... those are beautiful!', '2009-10-21 21:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696401, 828048, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I like the blue and black with white highlights.</td>', 'Nicely done. I like the blue and black with white highlights.', '2009-10-21 21:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696403, 828461, 77196, '<td valign="top">All three are very nice waterfalls shots. Nice motion in the water, excellent detail and colors.</td>', 'All three are very nice waterfalls shots. Nice motion in the water, excellent detail and colors.', '2009-10-21 21:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696404, 828483, 98171, '<td valign="top">yay i learned enough in french to know what the title means =) Very nice, the B&amp;W just MAKES it, and i love the UNsymmetry of your frames. 10</td>', 'yay i learned enough in french to know what the title means =) Very nice, the B&W just MAKES it, and i love the UNsymmetry of your frames. 10', '2009-10-21 21:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696406, 828641, 77196, '<td valign="top">Serenity. Makes one want to sit and think for a bit. Nice lighting and detail.</td>', 'Serenity. Makes one want to sit and think for a bit. Nice lighting and detail.', '2009-10-21 21:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696409, 828797, 77196, '<td valign="top">Absolutely adorable. Only nit would be to maybe lose some or most of the white post in the right pane.</td>', 'Absolutely adorable. Only nit would be to maybe lose some or most of the white post in the right pane.', '2009-10-21 21:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696410, 828731, 98171, '<td valign="top">wowie, awesome capture. I watched a heron in the water for 30 minutes waiting for this to happen, but he didn''t... lucky you! love the progression here, I''m glad you managed to get all 3 steps into the triptych. 8</td>', 'wowie, awesome capture. I watched a heron in the water for 30 minutes waiting for this to happen, but he didn''t... lucky you! love the progression here, I''m glad you managed to get all 3 steps into the triptych. 8', '2009-10-21 21:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696412, 828663, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wow! Wonderful color in the sky. Excellent detail on the owl.</td>', 'Wow! Wonderful color in the sky. Excellent detail on the owl.', '2009-10-21 21:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696413, 828708, 63269, '<td valign="top">This makes me smile... quiet images of such an oridinary, daily event... well done. I especially like the one in the top right corner.</td>', 'This makes me smile... quiet images of such an oridinary, daily event... well done. I especially like the one in the top right corner.', '2009-10-21 21:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696414, 828726, 98171, '<td valign="top">i love dandelions, they''re so fun to photograph. Only complaint is the picture is a bit dull. Maybe the brightness and/or saturation needed to be upped.</td>', 'i love dandelions, they''re so fun to photograph. Only complaint is the picture is a bit dull. Maybe the brightness and/or saturation needed to be upped.', '2009-10-21 21:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
