(5696417, 827951, 98171, '<td valign="top">very nice use of the lensbaby....</td>', 'very nice use of the lensbaby....', '2009-10-21 21:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696418, 828425, 63269, '<td valign="top">gorgeous lighting.</td>', 'gorgeous lighting.', '2009-10-21 21:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696420, 828718, 63269, '<td valign="top">This is probably just me, but I wish the images weren''t all so similar... maybe if one of them was a close-up of her face? Otherwise I like these a lot!</td>', 'This is probably just me, but I wish the images weren''t all so similar... maybe if one of them was a close-up of her face? Otherwise I like these a lot!', '2009-10-21 21:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696424, 828497, 77196, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like you''re looking out through a window. Nice lighting and color. Looks like you lost some nice cloud formations at the very top.</td>', 'Almost looks like you''re looking out through a window. Nice lighting and color. Looks like you lost some nice cloud formations at the very top.', '2009-10-21 21:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696425, 827798, 63269, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a little harsh, and a little dark here to me.</td>', 'The lighting seems a little harsh, and a little dark here to me.', '2009-10-21 21:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696429, 828717, 106233, '<td valign="top">Great picture, but DNMC IMO. I think that this is just one picture</td>', 'Great picture, but DNMC IMO. I think that this is just one picture', '2009-10-21 21:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696430, 828469, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great attempt at a very difficult task. The bottom pane is very nice - I like the lighting and highlight of the bird''s head / neck. Perhaps could lose a good deal of the tree at the far right of the bottom pane. Pan motion is very difficult - especially with a bird, and both of your top frames are OOF. Top left, the bird is almost in silhouette - without the one wing, it would almost look like a shadow. Top right pane, bird is still OOF, and its head is lost in the background.</td>', 'Great attempt at a very difficult task. The bottom pane is very nice - I like the lighting and highlight of the bird''s head / neck. Perhaps could lose a good deal of the tree at the far right of the bottom pane. Pan motion is very difficult - especially with a bird, and both of your top frames are OOF. Top left, the bird is almost in silhouette - without the one wing, it would almost look like a shadow. Top right pane, bird is still OOF, and its head is lost in the background.', '2009-10-21 21:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696431, 827857, 63269, '<td valign="top">When I first saw this it seemed wrong somehow, but the more I look at it, the more I intrigued I am. I think it has something to do with the fact that there are three completly different sized objects, and most triptychs are with equally sized stuff. I also like the quiet color tones and the shallow DOF.</td>', 'When I first saw this it seemed wrong somehow, but the more I look at it, the more I intrigued I am. I think it has something to do with the fact that there are three completly different sized objects, and most triptychs are with equally sized stuff. I also like the quiet color tones and the shallow DOF.', '2009-10-21 21:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696432, 828150, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting juxtaposition of subjects. I like how you''ve blended colors at the edge of one pane into the next pane. IMO, the right pane is a bit too off from the others colorwise, which makes it stand out like right half / left half of image. Overall the image matches the title nicely.</td>', 'Interesting juxtaposition of subjects. I like how you''ve blended colors at the edge of one pane into the next pane. IMO, the right pane is a bit too off from the others colorwise, which makes it stand out like right half / left half of image. Overall the image matches the title nicely.', '2009-10-21 21:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696433, 828501, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like this blurry focus!</td>', 'I like this blurry focus!', '2009-10-21 21:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696434, 828493, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice and interesting choice to remove half the petals for the smaller panes. Nice lighting, exposure, detail, dof.</td>', 'Very nice and interesting choice to remove half the petals for the smaller panes. Nice lighting, exposure, detail, dof.', '2009-10-21 21:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696436, 828810, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice message / feel in this. Love the sun setting and darkening from left to right, as well as the motion of the kiss - either a very fast sunset or very slow kiss. Almost too much change from left pane to middle, though. The cachet of flowers take a bit to figure out at first.</td>', 'Very nice message / feel in this. Love the sun setting and darkening from left to right, as well as the motion of the kiss - either a very fast sunset or very slow kiss. Almost too much change from left pane to middle, though. The cachet of flowers take a bit to figure out at first.', '2009-10-21 21:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696439, 827792, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done. Nice lighting and colors, and illusion of there being just two pieces of fruit, with enough clues to know there is not. Is that a pair of oranges? Nit - top pane left edge is farther to the right than the bottom two panes.</td>', 'Very nicely done. Nice lighting and colors, and illusion of there being just two pieces of fruit, with enough clues to know there is not. Is that a pair of oranges? Nit - top pane left edge is farther to the right than the bottom two panes.', '2009-10-21 21:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696442, 828442, 77196, '<td valign="top">You''ll probably get voted down by all those who have never tried to take a picture of a snow globe. Rather devilish things to try to shoot well. I like the low key lighting of this; that the dragon in the globe is very visible. This is a very nice image.</td>', 'You''ll probably get voted down by all those who have never tried to take a picture of a snow globe. Rather devilish things to try to shoot well. I like the low key lighting of this; that the dragon in the globe is very visible. This is a very nice image.', '2009-10-21 21:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696443, 828412, 63269, '<td valign="top">I like this one - wonderful textures, and its interesting how the three photos seem to melt into each other.</td>', 'I like this one - wonderful textures, and its interesting how the three photos seem to melt into each other.', '2009-10-21 21:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696445, 828618, 63269, '<td valign="top">clever!</td>', 'clever!', '2009-10-21 21:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696446, 828829, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wake up! The 1:11, 2:22, 3:33 is a nice touch (bet that didn''t cooperate all the time). Very nicely done.</td>', 'Wake up! The 1:11, 2:22, 3:33 is a nice touch (bet that didn''t cooperate all the time). Very nicely done.', '2009-10-21 21:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696447, 828192, 63269, '<td valign="top">lovely lighting!</td>', 'lovely lighting!', '2009-10-21 21:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696449, 828673, 63269, '<td valign="top">Yum!</td>', 'Yum!', '2009-10-21 21:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696450, 828457, 77196, '<td valign="top">This is almost good enough to be in a hair styles guide at a beauty shop. With advanced editing, you''d have been able to do the little clean-ups of blemishes, etc. Interesting use of hues to convey different moods.</td>', 'This is almost good enough to be in a hair styles guide at a beauty shop. With advanced editing, you''d have been able to do the little clean-ups of blemishes, etc. Interesting use of hues to convey different moods.', '2009-10-21 21:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696451, 828412, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and DOF. A bit dark overall. So similar that the lines between the panes are almost invisible.</td>', 'Nice detail and DOF. A bit dark overall. So similar that the lines between the panes are almost invisible.', '2009-10-21 21:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696454, 828054, 77196, '<td valign="top">The drop shadows add a very nice touch. Love the clouds in the left pane. Difficult to get the lines of the different perspectives to parallel each other in the different panes, detracting from a smooth overall image. Still, I think this does a very nice job of conveying a "lifestyle".</td>', 'The drop shadows add a very nice touch. Love the clouds in the left pane. Difficult to get the lines of the different perspectives to parallel each other in the different panes, detracting from a smooth overall image. Still, I think this does a very nice job of conveying a "lifestyle".', '2009-10-21 21:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696455, 828240, 33672, '<td valign="top">great tones.</td>', 'great tones.', '2009-10-21 21:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696456, 828672, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. IMO, the right pane just doesn''t cut it - flower is too much edge on. Not sure if I like the black - blue - lavender/green background progression or not.</td>', 'Nice concept. IMO, the right pane just doesn''t cut it - flower is too much edge on. Not sure if I like the black - blue - lavender/green background progression or not.', '2009-10-21 21:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696457, 828471, 33672, '<td valign="top">Lighting is perfect. 10</td>', 'Lighting is perfect. 10', '2009-10-21 21:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696458, 828619, 33672, '<td valign="top">Very creative.</td>', 'Very creative.', '2009-10-21 21:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696459, 828786, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice owl shots. Great detail. Interesting that the middle one has no yellow in its eyes.</td>', 'Very nice owl shots. Great detail. Interesting that the middle one has no yellow in its eyes.', '2009-10-21 21:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696460, 828824, 63269, '<td valign="top">You''ll probably get a lot of comments about how this is underexposed.... but I actually like the exact brightness you have here. It seems to somehow enrich the colors. Perhaps just one of them should have a brighter exposure? Clever concept though, and good work. What if the last one had a person eating the pie?</td>', 'You''ll probably get a lot of comments about how this is underexposed.... but I actually like the exact brightness you have here. It seems to somehow enrich the colors. Perhaps just one of them should have a brighter exposure? Clever concept though, and good work. What if the last one had a person eating the pie?', '2009-10-21 21:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696462, 828744, 33672, '<td valign="top">Sweet idea and execution</td>', 'Sweet idea and execution', '2009-10-21 21:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696463, 828823, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. Nice choice for smaller panes. Nice feel to the snow, etc.</td>', 'I like this a lot. Nice choice for smaller panes. Nice feel to the snow, etc.', '2009-10-21 21:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696465, 828234, 33672, '<td valign="top">great work here!</td>', 'great work here!', '2009-10-21 21:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696466, 828746, 63269, '<td valign="top">The saturation seems a little harsh on the wheel, and all the red in the first two photos makes me almost wish there''s red in the last one... but I love the expression of that bird! Too funny... he must suspect thanksgiving is coming!</td>', 'The saturation seems a little harsh on the wheel, and all the red in the first two photos makes me almost wish there''s red in the last one... but I love the expression of that bird! Too funny... he must suspect thanksgiving is coming!', '2009-10-21 21:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696467, 827994, 33672, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution.. Made me laugh too!</td>', 'Great idea and execution.. Made me laugh too!', '2009-10-21 21:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696468, 828461, 63269, '<td valign="top">Nice composition!</td>', 'Nice composition!', '2009-10-21 21:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696469, 828701, 33672, '<td valign="top">I hope you mean before Autumn....</td>', 'I hope you mean before Autumn....', '2009-10-21 21:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696470, 828801, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice tones in this image. Wish the center pane was a little more obvious on its subject matter. Perhaps fewer fish, but complete with head and tail. The reel at the top is almost totally lost in the busyness of the center pane.</td>', 'Nice tones in this image. Wish the center pane was a little more obvious on its subject matter. Perhaps fewer fish, but complete with head and tail. The reel at the top is almost totally lost in the busyness of the center pane.', '2009-10-21 21:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696472, 828492, 33672, '<td valign="top">Could be a postcard.</td>', 'Could be a postcard.', '2009-10-21 21:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696473, 828663, 33672, '<td valign="top">Beautifully clear!</td>', 'Beautifully clear!', '2009-10-21 21:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696475, 828676, 77196, '<td valign="top">A well-made point. Images are nice, good progression, nice fairly uniform lighting between the panels. Bit dark on the man''s face in the right pane.</td>', 'A well-made point. Images are nice, good progression, nice fairly uniform lighting between the panels. Bit dark on the man''s face in the right pane.', '2009-10-21 21:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696476, 828150, 63269, '<td valign="top">I completely love this, of course, and I think I know who''s it is! ;)</td>', 'I completely love this, of course, and I think I know who''s it is! ;)', '2009-10-21 21:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696478, 828102, 33672, '<td valign="top">Sweet idea. Nice work</td>', 'Sweet idea. Nice work', '2009-10-21 21:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696480, 828240, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like the aniqueness of this - nice wood grains, natural lighting, iron / glass, and stove top details.</td>', 'I like the aniqueness of this - nice wood grains, natural lighting, iron / glass, and stove top details.', '2009-10-21 21:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696481, 828445, 63269, '<td valign="top">Is this the full 720 pixels? For some reason it seems small... and the borders are very cool and work well, but they almost distract from the apples. I really like the lighting though, and the whole concept you have here.</td>', 'Is this the full 720 pixels? For some reason it seems small... and the borders are very cool and work well, but they almost distract from the apples. I really like the lighting though, and the whole concept you have here.', '2009-10-21 21:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696482, 828556, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice fireworks shots. Great colors.</td>', 'Nice fireworks shots. Great colors.', '2009-10-21 21:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696484, 828823, 98339, '<td valign="top">this has got to be in the top 5...what a wonderful balance in your pictures...sure would like to learn how to do this...well done</td>', 'this has got to be in the top 5...what a wonderful balance in your pictures...sure would like to learn how to do this...well done', '2009-10-21 21:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696486, 828492, 98339, '<td valign="top">now this took some time to accomplish...excellent picture...love the end result</td>', 'now this took some time to accomplish...excellent picture...love the end result', '2009-10-21 21:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696488, 827944, 63269, '<td valign="top">Extremely well thought out, sophisticated work... I like this lots. So classy in the black and white!</td>', 'Extremely well thought out, sophisticated work... I like this lots. So classy in the black and white!', '2009-10-21 21:52:23.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5696489, 828790, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice hamster shots. Nice uniform background. Great detail on face &amp; whiskers.</td>', 'Very nice hamster shots. Nice uniform background. Great detail on face & whiskers.', '2009-10-21 21:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696493, 828406, 111197, '<td valign="top">the top photo can be replaced with something a bit less crazy!!</td>', 'the top photo can be replaced with something a bit less crazy!!', '2009-10-21 21:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696494, 828740, 77196, '<td valign="top">All three are great images. Train may be a bit light in comparison with other two panes.</td>', 'All three are great images. Train may be a bit light in comparison with other two panes.', '2009-10-21 21:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696495, 828717, 63269, '<td valign="top">I have no idea how you did this but it looks awesome. And yummy. :) I''m not sure how well it really works as a triptych though.</td>', 'I have no idea how you did this but it looks awesome. And yummy. :) I''m not sure how well it really works as a triptych though.', '2009-10-21 21:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696496, 828415, 77196, '<td valign="top">Makes me smile. I like zebra - coming or going. Nice use of stripes with B&amp;W image. Vey nice.</td>', 'Makes me smile. I like zebra - coming or going. Nice use of stripes with B&W image. Vey nice.', '2009-10-21 21:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696500, 828557, 77196, '<td valign="top">One drop with a very fast strobe, or three shots? All three are great captures. Excellent job of telling a story.</td>', 'One drop with a very fast strobe, or three shots? All three are great captures. Excellent job of telling a story.', '2009-10-21 21:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696501, 828717, 98171, '<td valign="top">this has been done before, multiple times. I  dont care for how you divided the frames up. You''re almost cutting the motion off with the black lines, I feel like I cant see the whole picture.</td>', 'this has been done before, multiple times. I  dont care for how you divided the frames up. You''re almost cutting the motion off with the black lines, I feel like I cant see the whole picture.', '2009-10-21 21:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696503, 828619, 77196, '<td valign="top">In a Baptist church? Nice concept and well executed. Too bad about the car &amp; truck reflections.</td>', 'In a Baptist church? Nice concept and well executed. Too bad about the car & truck reflections.', '2009-10-21 22:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696504, 828785, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great concept &amp; nicely done. Yellow look like it is a bit over and lost the detail in the light, but that''s being really picky.</td>', 'Great concept & nicely done. Yellow look like it is a bit over and lost the detail in the light, but that''s being really picky.', '2009-10-21 22:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696505, 828048, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love the color scheme you have here - brilliant work!</td>', 'I love the color scheme you have here - brilliant work!', '2009-10-21 22:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696506, 828808, 63269, '<td valign="top">very neat composition!</td>', 'very neat composition!', '2009-10-21 22:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696507, 828504, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great pictures.</td>', 'Great pictures.', '2009-10-21 22:05:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696508, 828824, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. Tells story nicely. Overall, image is a bit dark.</td>', 'Nice concept. Tells story nicely. Overall, image is a bit dark.', '2009-10-21 22:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696509, 828121, 77196, '<td valign="top">That doesn''t look like a small gator! Nice images that blend nicely together. Bottom right pane seems a bit hot in comparison to the other two.</td>', 'That doesn''t look like a small gator! Nice images that blend nicely together. Bottom right pane seems a bit hot in comparison to the other two.', '2009-10-21 22:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696510, 828817, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the totally white sky. Nice view of the skyline, though.</td>', 'Not sure I like the totally white sky. Nice view of the skyline, though.', '2009-10-21 22:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696511, 828661, 63269, '<td valign="top">I love this so much. Each individual image, on it''s own, is pretty, but together they create an exquisite image which captures that golden atmosphere - that mood - of fall. It''s as if one photo cannot accururately capture the whole of fall, but little individual tastes in a triptych like this can. Just glorious! A 9 from me!</td>', 'I love this so much. Each individual image, on it''s own, is pretty, but together they create an exquisite image which captures that golden atmosphere - that mood - of fall. It''s as if one photo cannot accururately capture the whole of fall, but little individual tastes in a triptych like this can. Just glorious! A 9 from me!', '2009-10-21 22:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696514, 828501, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Tells a story, sequences from top to bottom. Similar backgrounds and coloring. Middle pane could use a bit more DOF IMO. Nice capture of white "fuzz" in lower pane and detail in upper pane.</td>', 'Very nice. Tells a story, sequences from top to bottom. Similar backgrounds and coloring. Middle pane could use a bit more DOF IMO. Nice capture of white "fuzz" in lower pane and detail in upper pane.', '2009-10-21 22:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696516, 828192, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Somehow it seems to incorporate a fair amount of "extra" material and doesn''t focus in on the primary image. For example, in the left pane, the lower flower is there, OOF and not really contributing much to the shot. Bottom right pane is basically two images - the buds to the left and the flower to the right with a fairly wide mostly white band between the two. Top right is better, but has extra material above and to the left of the buds. IMO, nothing wrong with the shots - just need to "zoom in" on the key idea and lose the "extras". Sometimes more is not better - it is just more.</td>', 'Nice image. Somehow it seems to incorporate a fair amount of "extra" material and doesn''t focus in on the primary image. For example, in the left pane, the lower flower is there, OOF and not really contributing much to the shot. Bottom right pane is basically two images - the buds to the left and the flower to the right with a fairly wide mostly white band between the two. Top right is better, but has extra material above and to the left of the buds. IMO, nothing wrong with the shots - just need to "zoom in" on the key idea and lose the "extras". Sometimes more is not better - it is just more.', '2009-10-21 22:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696518, 828405, 77196, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Love the lighting in the top pane, the "tractor" in the bottom left. Both of those are deep DOF shots. IMO, the bottom right has issues because of the lighting angle and shallow DOF. The part of the dog''s head towards the camera is mostly in shadow. On the positive side, the color themes are carried throughout, including the bottom right pane.</td>', 'Beautiful. Love the lighting in the top pane, the "tractor" in the bottom left. Both of those are deep DOF shots. IMO, the bottom right has issues because of the lighting angle and shallow DOF. The part of the dog''s head towards the camera is mostly in shadow. On the positive side, the color themes are carried throughout, including the bottom right pane.', '2009-10-21 22:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696519, 828452, 77196, '<td valign="top">Absolutely gorgeous colors in the bridge rocks and foliage in the background. Drop shadow around panes adds to interest.</td>', 'Absolutely gorgeous colors in the bridge rocks and foliage in the background. Drop shadow around panes adds to interest.', '2009-10-21 22:17:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696521, 828717, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect. A cookie allows you to break out of jail? Nice capture and splash.</td>', 'Interesting effect. A cookie allows you to break out of jail? Nice capture and splash.', '2009-10-21 22:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696522, 828356, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great images, lighting, and arrangement.</td>', 'Great images, lighting, and arrangement.', '2009-10-21 22:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696524, 828045, 78599, '<td valign="top">I imagine a black frame would have done so much for this shot, but tahts just me :) Awesome capture :)</td>', 'I imagine a black frame would have done so much for this shot, but tahts just me :) Awesome capture :)', '2009-10-21 22:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696525, 827999, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept and use of coloration. I think the offset panes add to this image - neatly aligned would contradict the title.</td>', 'Interesting concept and use of coloration. I think the offset panes add to this image - neatly aligned would contradict the title.', '2009-10-21 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696527, 828772, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like the blue, black &amp; white motif. The center pane carries a lot of emotion and energy. Left and right panes are so dark they hide their contents. In the left pane, the white angled line seems very out of place.</td>', 'I like the blue, black & white motif. The center pane carries a lot of emotion and energy. Left and right panes are so dark they hide their contents. In the left pane, the white angled line seems very out of place.', '2009-10-21 22:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696530, 828732, 77196, '<td valign="top">What did I just see? Who was that cat? This is cute and does a great job of telling a story.</td>', 'What did I just see? Who was that cat? This is cute and does a great job of telling a story.', '2009-10-21 22:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696531, 828079, 77196, '<td valign="top">Lots of lines going on here. To me, this is more of a pattern image. As such, it succeeds quite well with all the angles. Nice tones and uniformity of color / lightness.</td>', 'Lots of lines going on here. To me, this is more of a pattern image. As such, it succeeds quite well with all the angles. Nice tones and uniformity of color / lightness.', '2009-10-21 22:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696534, 828746, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting image. You''ve done some things here that are a bit unusual. You''ve combined bright colored images of the turkey head and wheel, with a natural tan shot of the corn. Not sure the small borders help. Much of the top pane is OOF due to shallow DOF and includes much more than is needed above the turkey head.</td>', 'Interesting image. You''ve done some things here that are a bit unusual. You''ve combined bright colored images of the turkey head and wheel, with a natural tan shot of the corn. Not sure the small borders help. Much of the top pane is OOF due to shallow DOF and includes much more than is needed above the turkey head.', '2009-10-21 22:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696535, 828025, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice sequence shot. Like the colors, except the tan in the middle and right panes. The tan isn''t too bad, but I think it''d look better with green background.</td>', 'Nice sequence shot. Like the colors, except the tan in the middle and right panes. The tan isn''t too bad, but I think it''d look better with green background.', '2009-10-21 22:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696537, 828271, 77196, '<td valign="top">OK. Who told you where I live? I actually went and bought a weed whacker - then the weather turned rainy and cold. I can relate to the image. A bit too much shadow in the left and right panes. Great poses.</td>', 'OK. Who told you where I live? I actually went and bought a weed whacker - then the weather turned rainy and cold. I can relate to the image. A bit too much shadow in the left and right panes. Great poses.', '2009-10-21 22:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696538, 828101, 77196, '<td valign="top">People look better when they smile. Nice high key shots, and nice arrangement.</td>', 'People look better when they smile. Nice high key shots, and nice arrangement.', '2009-10-21 22:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696539, 828719, 76598, '<td valign="top">Unless I am missing something, your images seem to lack a focus.  Perhaps it is intended to be the emptiness, but I miss the point.   The photographic quality is acceptable, but artistically I miss the point.</td>', 'Unless I am missing something, your images seem to lack a focus.  Perhaps it is intended to be the emptiness, but I miss the point.   The photographic quality is acceptable, but artistically I miss the point.', '2009-10-21 22:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696540, 827857, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very uniform images in color and lightness. Not very interesting subjects on their own, but the juxtaposition of tires, potato, and shoe makes you wonder why. IMO, the potato is too far to the right of its pane.</td>', 'Very uniform images in color and lightness. Not very interesting subjects on their own, but the juxtaposition of tires, potato, and shoe makes you wonder why. IMO, the potato is too far to the right of its pane.', '2009-10-21 22:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696541, 828052, 76598, '<td valign="top">I assume the intent is to imply that the one lady appears out of the light or something, but most of what I see is images with a poor focus and the sun causing a real hot spot</td>', 'I assume the intent is to imply that the one lady appears out of the light or something, but most of what I see is images with a poor focus and the sun causing a real hot spot', '2009-10-21 22:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696542, 828008, 76598, '<td valign="top">The depth of field is so shallow in most of these images that they have no impact.  If all three were bees, or other insects, this might have worked, but as it is I feel that it misses the mark....not visually compelling.</td>', 'The depth of field is so shallow in most of these images that they have no impact.  If all three were bees, or other insects, this might have worked, but as it is I feel that it misses the mark....not visually compelling.', '2009-10-21 22:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696543, 828618, 75618, '<td valign="top">I love the minimalism.</td>', 'I love the minimalism.', '2009-10-21 22:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696544, 828514, 76598, '<td valign="top">focus seems soft, other than the color changes they aren''t compelling images.</td>', 'focus seems soft, other than the color changes they aren''t compelling images.', '2009-10-21 22:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696545, 827994, 75618, '<td valign="top">Very funny and inventive. I don''t know if it''s intentional but I especially like the blur in the second picture.</td>', 'Very funny and inventive. I don''t know if it''s intentional but I especially like the blur in the second picture.', '2009-10-21 22:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696547, 828785, 76598, '<td valign="top">cute idea, but my sense is that it is being lost in the translation.  Not very crisp, seems to not be in focus...tough to do at night....just doesn''t come together for me.</td>', 'cute idea, but my sense is that it is being lost in the translation.  Not very crisp, seems to not be in focus...tough to do at night....just doesn''t come together for me.', '2009-10-21 22:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696549, 828657, 77196, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s standing straighter already! Nice expressions. Images are not from the same distance, making him look different heights (even accounting for the hair loss). The crop at the bottom of each pane is not at the same place on him (just below navel, just above pants, below top of pants). Perhaps that is on purpose.</td>', 'Looks like he''s standing straighter already! Nice expressions. Images are not from the same distance, making him look different heights (even accounting for the hair loss). The crop at the bottom of each pane is not at the same place on him (just below navel, just above pants, below top of pants). Perhaps that is on purpose.', '2009-10-21 22:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696552, 828249, 77196, '<td valign="top">I love old buildings. These are great images and work well together.</td>', 'I love old buildings. These are great images and work well together.', '2009-10-21 22:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696553, 828731, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and image tells a story (rather sad one for the fish...)</td>', 'Great lighting and image tells a story (rather sad one for the fish...)', '2009-10-21 22:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696554, 828344, 77196, '<td valign="top">Cute. Nice images that work well together. Love her expression in the right pane. It basically makes the image.</td>', 'Cute. Nice images that work well together. Love her expression in the right pane. It basically makes the image.', '2009-10-21 22:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696556, 828514, 77196, '<td valign="top">Using colors of the Irish flag? Great idea. Excellent shots. Almost loose the top / sides of the glass against the white and green. Nice beveled edges too.</td>', 'Using colors of the Irish flag? Great idea. Excellent shots. Almost loose the top / sides of the glass against the white and green. Nice beveled edges too.', '2009-10-21 22:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696559, 828314, 77196, '<td valign="top">This looks overprocessed. Nice colors and lots of detail on the buildings, dark skies.</td>', 'This looks overprocessed. Nice colors and lots of detail on the buildings, dark skies.', '2009-10-21 22:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696561, 828471, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting. All 3 shots are strong on their own, and combine to convey a feeling of end of day.</td>', 'Very nice lighting. All 3 shots are strong on their own, and combine to convey a feeling of end of day.', '2009-10-21 22:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696562, 828815, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but oh that pole and power lines in the right pane. It also looks tilted. Great expression.</td>', 'Very nice, but oh that pole and power lines in the right pane. It also looks tilted. Great expression.', '2009-10-21 22:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696564, 828783, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice image. A bit too close crop on left side of left pane.</td>', 'Nice image. A bit too close crop on left side of left pane.', '2009-10-21 22:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696565, 828008, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and colors. Pane on left is too dark. Both left and right panes are too OOF.</td>', 'Nice concept and colors. Pane on left is too dark. Both left and right panes are too OOF.', '2009-10-21 22:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696568, 828686, 77196, '<td valign="top">Different subject matter - like the use of the laser and the same color / width as border. IMO, the light and blade guard of the saw are OOF and distracts from the image.</td>', 'Different subject matter - like the use of the laser and the same color / width as border. IMO, the light and blade guard of the saw are OOF and distracts from the image.', '2009-10-21 22:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696570, 827994, 77196, '<td valign="top">Cute. Nicely done. A bit hot on the middle feed in the middle pane.</td>', 'Cute. Nicely done. A bit hot on the middle feed in the middle pane.', '2009-10-21 22:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696571, 828811, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting in upper pane. Tells a story. Nice action shot in lower left pane. Lighting and tonals slightly different in lower right pane. Very nice image.</td>', 'Nice lighting in upper pane. Tells a story. Nice action shot in lower left pane. Lighting and tonals slightly different in lower right pane. Very nice image.', '2009-10-21 22:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696577, 828808, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice image - take a closer look. Some veins almost line up from pane to pane. Nice even lighting across image.</td>', 'Nice image - take a closer look. Some veins almost line up from pane to pane. Nice even lighting across image.', '2009-10-21 22:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696578, 828634, 77196, '<td valign="top">Looks like this wedding wasn''t on the level. The left pane is overexposed, losing all detail in her dress and his forehead / top of nose is too hot. Love the roses and rings. Also, the signing of the marriage certificate is very nice.</td>', 'Looks like this wedding wasn''t on the level. The left pane is overexposed, losing all detail in her dress and his forehead / top of nose is too hot. Love the roses and rings. Also, the signing of the marriage certificate is very nice.', '2009-10-21 22:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696580, 828522, 77196, '<td valign="top">Good detail. Nice color. Brown and red look pretty similar to me. Something bothers me about the arrangement of the veins - the look hodge-podge rather than having some function in the overall image.</td>', 'Good detail. Nice color. Brown and red look pretty similar to me. Something bothers me about the arrangement of the veins - the look hodge-podge rather than having some function in the overall image.', '2009-10-21 23:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696581, 828792, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Nice lighting. Nice detail with sweat on left pane, but not on right two.</td>', 'Very nice. Nice lighting. Nice detail with sweat on left pane, but not on right two.', '2009-10-21 23:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696582, 828754, 77196, '<td valign="top">Your score should fly with this one. I like the way you''ve captured the incandescence of the fly body &amp; wings.</td>', 'Your score should fly with this one. I like the way you''ve captured the incandescence of the fly body & wings.', '2009-10-21 23:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696584, 828632, 77196, '<td valign="top">I''ll take the middle one, please. Nice captures of expressions. A bit dark on the one side of her face in the left pane. IMO, this would have been much more effective with a fill-the-frame crop of each expression. I think the head tilt (and color cues) would have conveyed enough of the emotion to work.</td>', 'I''ll take the middle one, please. Nice captures of expressions. A bit dark on the one side of her face in the left pane. IMO, this would have been much more effective with a fill-the-frame crop of each expression. I think the head tilt (and color cues) would have conveyed enough of the emotion to work.', '2009-10-21 23:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696585, 828743, 77196, '<td valign="top">Shooting low light and moving subjects is tough. The right pane is a bit too dark. The others are a bit OOF.</td>', 'Shooting low light and moving subjects is tough. The right pane is a bit too dark. The others are a bit OOF.', '2009-10-21 23:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696587, 828446, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice parallels of perspectives and lines. Not sure B &amp; W was best choice for this, but that depends on what color (if any) was present. A blue sky might have been a nice accent - but it looks like it is overcast.</td>', 'Nice parallels of perspectives and lines. Not sure B & W was best choice for this, but that depends on what color (if any) was present. A blue sky might have been a nice accent - but it looks like it is overcast.', '2009-10-21 23:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696592, 828820, 77196, '<td valign="top">In most challenges, there is an image that just totally stands out from the rest. This is it (so far) for me. Beautiful pictures, wonderful muted colors, each pane blends beautifully to form a complete image. It isn''t just the pictures, but it creates a mood - a sense of completeness with a distant shot, and two closeups of wildlife. 10</td>', 'In most challenges, there is an image that just totally stands out from the rest. This is it (so far) for me. Beautiful pictures, wonderful muted colors, each pane blends beautifully to form a complete image. It isn''t just the pictures, but it creates a mood - a sense of completeness with a distant shot, and two closeups of wildlife. 10', '2009-10-21 23:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696593, 828381, 77196, '<td valign="top">Love the colors. Very, very nice.</td>', 'Love the colors. Very, very nice.', '2009-10-21 23:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696594, 828234, 77196, '<td valign="top">What a spectacular spot! Nice lighting.</td>', 'What a spectacular spot! Nice lighting.', '2009-10-21 23:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696595, 828719, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I don''t think this will score well, but it does tell a compelling story.</td>', 'Interesting. I don''t think this will score well, but it does tell a compelling story.', '2009-10-21 23:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696596, 828406, 77196, '<td valign="top">Adorable expressions. Top pane is a bit forced, but still cute.</td>', 'Adorable expressions. Top pane is a bit forced, but still cute.', '2009-10-21 23:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696597, 828208, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice horses. They do stop eating to allow you to take their pictures? Beautiful colors, nice detail.</td>', 'Nice horses. They do stop eating to allow you to take their pictures? Beautiful colors, nice detail.', '2009-10-21 23:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696598, 828241, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors. IMO, I''d have cropped the left panes to get rid of all or most of the white flower. It is enough out of character with the rest of the image that it "glares".</td>', 'Wonderful colors. IMO, I''d have cropped the left panes to get rid of all or most of the white flower. It is enough out of character with the rest of the image that it "glares".', '2009-10-21 23:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696599, 828723, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and interesting subject. Love the red &amp; white pole. Top pane is a tad dark vs. the other two panes.</td>', 'Nice lighting and interesting subject. Love the red & white pole. Top pane is a tad dark vs. the other two panes.', '2009-10-21 23:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696600, 828045, 77196, '<td valign="top">Right one almost looks like a wine glass.</td>', 'Right one almost looks like a wine glass.', '2009-10-21 23:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696601, 828726, 77196, '<td valign="top">It tells a story. Nice uniformity between images. This feels destructive to me, and is disquieting. Stupid, huh?</td>', 'It tells a story. Nice uniformity between images. This feels destructive to me, and is disquieting. Stupid, huh?', '2009-10-21 23:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696603, 828505, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wow! Looks like quite a fire. The big white building in the foreground on the top pane is a distraction. Great capture - especially the height of the flames in the bottom left pane.</td>', 'Wow! Looks like quite a fire. The big white building in the foreground on the top pane is a distraction. Great capture - especially the height of the flames in the bottom left pane.', '2009-10-21 23:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696605, 828733, 77196, '<td valign="top">Good enough to be a post card. Bronze / shiny metal is particularly difficult to photograph well, but you''ve done so here.</td>', 'Good enough to be a post card. Bronze / shiny metal is particularly difficult to photograph well, but you''ve done so here.', '2009-10-21 23:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696606, 828318, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like the variegated colors in the water.</td>', 'I like the variegated colors in the water.', '2009-10-21 23:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696608, 828701, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Nice bike. Not sure about the power pole &amp; lines in main pane, or b&amp;w of bottom left pane. I do like that the bike is facing opposite directions in the two smaller panes.</td>', 'Very nice. Nice bike. Not sure about the power pole & lines in main pane, or b&w of bottom left pane. I do like that the bike is facing opposite directions in the two smaller panes.', '2009-10-21 23:23:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696609, 828767, 77196, '<td valign="top">OK. That''s a bit creepy. The hear no evil hand position is not clear without the title. Nice contrasts between the black &amp; white.</td>', 'OK. That''s a bit creepy. The hear no evil hand position is not clear without the title. Nice contrasts between the black & white.', '2009-10-21 23:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696610, 828718, 77196, '<td valign="top">Spooky! Excellent capture of her eyes in the right pane, with the moon in the background.</td>', 'Spooky! Excellent capture of her eyes in the right pane, with the moon in the background.', '2009-10-21 23:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696611, 828386, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice colors &amp; different perspectives. Does no one ride?</td>', 'Nice colors & different perspectives. Does no one ride?', '2009-10-21 23:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696613, 828782, 77196, '<td valign="top">Excellent color contrasts. Not sure I like the veins all centered in each pane, but at least they are purposefully arranged, and serve to create a single image, rather than each competing for the viewer''s attention.</td>', 'Excellent color contrasts. Not sure I like the veins all centered in each pane, but at least they are purposefully arranged, and serve to create a single image, rather than each competing for the viewer''s attention.', '2009-10-21 23:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696614, 828816, 77196, '<td valign="top">A bit too subtle for the casual observer. Great concept, nicely executed.</td>', 'A bit too subtle for the casual observer. Great concept, nicely executed.', '2009-10-21 23:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696616, 828570, 77196, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. Not sure what to say about this. For me, the focal point is the big mask''s mouth, and that area is OOF in all 3 panes. I like the idea of progression from pane to pane. IMO, you could lose the lower half of the image without losing the message.</td>', 'Hmmm. Not sure what to say about this. For me, the focal point is the big mask''s mouth, and that area is OOF in all 3 panes. I like the idea of progression from pane to pane. IMO, you could lose the lower half of the image without losing the message.', '2009-10-21 23:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696617, 827981, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting sequence. I love the color in these shots. Glad I don''t have to go out and shoo away pigeons on a regular basis, but what pink garment is he using?</td>', 'Interesting sequence. I love the color in these shots. Glad I don''t have to go out and shoo away pigeons on a regular basis, but what pink garment is he using?', '2009-10-21 23:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696619, 828552, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice job. Center pane almost looks like a girl dancing. Excellent contrast, lighting, and colors.</td>', 'Nice job. Center pane almost looks like a girl dancing. Excellent contrast, lighting, and colors.', '2009-10-21 23:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696621, 828773, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Very pretty bird. Right pane is a lot of distracting in-focus backgound (instead of the narrow DOF of the other two shots), and very little bird - bird kind-of gets lost in the background.</td>', 'Very nice. Very pretty bird. Right pane is a lot of distracting in-focus backgound (instead of the narrow DOF of the other two shots), and very little bird - bird kind-of gets lost in the background.', '2009-10-21 23:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696623, 827951, 77196, '<td valign="top">Looks like they met with some frost. I like the common colors / background in all 3 panes.</td>', 'Looks like they met with some frost. I like the common colors / background in all 3 panes.', '2009-10-21 23:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696624, 828441, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. The pictures almost glow.</td>', 'Nice lighting. The pictures almost glow.', '2009-10-21 23:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696625, 828673, 77196, '<td valign="top">Not sure a peach border goes well with orange or honey or bread. I like the tones in the panes - especially that runny golden honey.</td>', 'Not sure a peach border goes well with orange or honey or bread. I like the tones in the panes - especially that runny golden honey.', '2009-10-21 23:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696626, 828385, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice image. I can''t make up my mind about the backgrounds. I do like that the image tells a story.</td>', 'Nice image. I can''t make up my mind about the backgrounds. I do like that the image tells a story.', '2009-10-21 23:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696627, 828445, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. A bit too dark on the left and right panes, IMO.</td>', 'Nicely done. A bit too dark on the left and right panes, IMO.', '2009-10-21 23:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696628, 827919, 77196, '<td valign="top">Ahhh. Nice. Even lighting in all panes. Common color theme. This image captures the sax with style.</td>', 'Ahhh. Nice. Even lighting in all panes. Common color theme. This image captures the sax with style.', '2009-10-21 23:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696630, 828700, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great concept. Love the overlap of image outside of frame. Almost lose the camera in the border.</td>', 'Great concept. Love the overlap of image outside of frame. Almost lose the camera in the border.', '2009-10-21 23:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696631, 828806, 77196, '<td valign="top">I like how it tells a story. Must be tough to shoot these ducks with that stark white spot on their heads.</td>', 'I like how it tells a story. Must be tough to shoot these ducks with that stark white spot on their heads.', '2009-10-21 23:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696633, 827799, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice, crisp, clear pictures, with highlights but no blow out hot spots.</td>', 'Nice, crisp, clear pictures, with highlights but no blow out hot spots.', '2009-10-21 23:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696635, 828548, 77196, '<td valign="top">Cute. A bit obscure, but it tells a story.</td>', 'Cute. A bit obscure, but it tells a story.', '2009-10-21 23:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696636, 828277, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice antique. nice images, well arranged. Couldn''t help advertising a bit, eh?</td>', 'Nice antique. nice images, well arranged. Couldn''t help advertising a bit, eh?', '2009-10-21 23:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696637, 828104, 77196, '<td valign="top">Normally I complain about OOF, but it really works here. Very nice overall image. The OOF allows you to get away with other minor "issues" (or nits) - like the dark spots on the upper petals in the right pane.</td>', 'Normally I complain about OOF, but it really works here. Very nice overall image. The OOF allows you to get away with other minor "issues" (or nits) - like the dark spots on the upper petals in the right pane.', '2009-10-21 23:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696638, 828052, 77196, '<td valign="top">OK. That''s pretty weird. I didn''t know you were a magician. Images are too dark to be engaging. I find this image confusing as to its message.</td>', 'OK. That''s pretty weird. I didn''t know you were a magician. Images are too dark to be engaging. I find this image confusing as to its message.', '2009-10-21 23:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696639, 828791, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice, even lighting and contrast. I like the stair step down arrangement (heaven to hell).</td>', 'Nice, even lighting and contrast. I like the stair step down arrangement (heaven to hell).', '2009-10-21 23:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696641, 828661, 77196, '<td valign="top">Center image is too yellow for my tastes, but you had to do that to keep the mood, which this images does very well. Nice leaf shots top and bottom. Engaging picture for the middle pane.</td>', 'Center image is too yellow for my tastes, but you had to do that to keep the mood, which this images does very well. Nice leaf shots top and bottom. Engaging picture for the middle pane.', '2009-10-21 23:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696642, 827944, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. There''s lots to this image that doesn''t grab you at first glance. Little details (like the "body" not looking at you) that add lots of meaning.</td>', 'Nicely done. There''s lots to this image that doesn''t grab you at first glance. Little details (like the "body" not looking at you) that add lots of meaning.', '2009-10-21 23:49:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696643, 828199, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, but the differences in lighting does not lend itself to putting these images together. Each individual pane is a beautiful and well done shot.</td>', 'Interesting concept, but the differences in lighting does not lend itself to putting these images together. Each individual pane is a beautiful and well done shot.', '2009-10-21 23:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696644, 828618, 77196, '<td valign="top">Falling. I like the simplicity of this. Nit - not sure I like left pane''s stem going right up to corner.</td>', 'Falling. I like the simplicity of this. Nit - not sure I like left pane''s stem going right up to corner.', '2009-10-21 23:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696646, 828802, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great Image. Love the sense of motion. Each pane has one object of central attention, but together they make one image. Even the stairstep down arrangement helps with the sense of movement.</td>', 'Great Image. Love the sense of motion. Each pane has one object of central attention, but together they make one image. Even the stairstep down arrangement helps with the sense of movement.', '2009-10-21 23:52:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696648, 828744, 77196, '<td valign="top">This is good enough to fool the eye at first glance. Very well done. I thought ears grew as you get older, not shrink!</td>', 'This is good enough to fool the eye at first glance. Very well done. I thought ears grew as you get older, not shrink!', '2009-10-21 23:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696650, 828731, 73056, '<td valign="top">This looks like someone I may know! Great capture!</td>', 'This looks like someone I may know! Great capture!', '2009-10-21 23:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696651, 828158, 73056, '<td valign="top">I love how frogs look like they''re smiling. Cute!</td>', 'I love how frogs look like they''re smiling. Cute!', '2009-10-21 23:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696654, 828442, 73056, '<td valign="top">Nice conversions and lighting.</td>', 'Nice conversions and lighting.', '2009-10-21 23:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696655, 828102, 73056, '<td valign="top">Nice idea!</td>', 'Nice idea!', '2009-10-21 23:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696656, 828491, 77196, '<td valign="top">What a great capture! IMO, the beveling around the edge of the photos did not help, nor does the black border. These shots want to fly - not be hemmed in with a stark border.</td>', 'What a great capture! IMO, the beveling around the edge of the photos did not help, nor does the black border. These shots want to fly - not be hemmed in with a stark border.', '2009-10-22 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
