(5696662, 828722, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great expressions, but the ball-only right pane just doesn''t work for me. The first two frames show a girl, then the right one shows just a ball - not what I would expect. Even if the center pane had the ball in it, it would make more sense. Good lighting. Picture frame in background is distracting in middle and right panes.</td>', 'Great expressions, but the ball-only right pane just doesn''t work for me. The first two frames show a girl, then the right one shows just a ball - not what I would expect. Even if the center pane had the ball in it, it would make more sense. Good lighting. Picture frame in background is distracting in middle and right panes.', '2009-10-22 00:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
