(5696799, 828719, 108580, '<td valign="top">I see what you''ve done here. I think. Trolley making a dash for it and then whiping out at end of pathway, last pic from it''s POV lying on it''s side. The white OOF border on RHS in shot 2 spoils it though. (In hindsight this may be someone sneaking a look around the corner, so bumped another one point up for creativity.)</td>', 'I see what you''ve done here. I think. Trolley making a dash for it and then whiping out at end of pathway, last pic from it''s POV lying on it''s side. The white OOF border on RHS in shot 2 spoils it though. (In hindsight this may be someone sneaking a look around the corner, so bumped another one point up for creativity.)', '2009-10-22 03:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696800, 828347, 108580, '<td valign="top">Great story telling and capture of the active bird as well as the expression on the boys face. The top left frame looks out of perspective and squished.</td>', 'Great story telling and capture of the active bird as well as the expression on the boys face. The top left frame looks out of perspective and squished.', '2009-10-22 03:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696801, 828817, 5364, '<td valign="top">It''s a good idea, but I feel you could have put a more prominent building in the left panel and centred the right hand panel on the tall building rather than having it off-centre as it is.</td>', 'It''s a good idea, but I feel you could have put a more prominent building in the left panel and centred the right hand panel on the tall building rather than having it off-centre as it is.', '2009-10-22 03:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696802, 828492, 108580, '<td valign="top">These are really beautiful peaceful photo''s.</td>', 'These are really beautiful peaceful photo''s.', '2009-10-22 03:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
