(5696853, 828192, 69368, '<td valign="top">fantastic blossom-colored! The play between blossom and soft tones are really beautiful.</td>', 'fantastic blossom-colored! The play between blossom and soft tones are really beautiful.', '2009-10-22 05:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696854, 828501, 69368, '<td valign="top">wonderful moody image! The softness is just perfect!</td>', 'wonderful moody image! The softness is just perfect!', '2009-10-22 05:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696885, 828492, 57447, '<td valign="top">I like how silvery this is.</td>', 'I like how silvery this is.', '2009-10-22 07:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696913, 828619, 111192, '<td valign="top">Would have preferred the outer images to have been cropped a little higher, perhaps without the steps, to strengthen the overall cross motif.</td>', 'Would have preferred the outer images to have been cropped a little higher, perhaps without the steps, to strengthen the overall cross motif.', '2009-10-22 08:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696916, 828829, 108580, '<td valign="top">Cute that it takes 1 hour and 11 minutes x 3 to get up on his feet. Batteries flat?</td>', 'Cute that it takes 1 hour and 11 minutes x 3 to get up on his feet. Batteries flat?', '2009-10-22 08:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696918, 828628, 108580, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and framing.</td>', 'Nice concept and framing.', '2009-10-22 08:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696919, 828733, 108580, '<td valign="top">Nice effort but the caption/logo is verboten.</td>', 'Nice effort but the caption/logo is verboten.', '2009-10-22 08:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696964, 828744, 76598, '<td valign="top">Strange in an interesting kind of way.  Excellent merge of the faces and a truly unique idea.  A family member could really appreciate this.  I think the one thing that might have improved it is a different (brighter, more colorful) background and a more colorful shirt.  It comes across as lacking ummmph and for me I think it is the color rather than the processing because everything is sharp and well focused with good contrast.</td>', 'Strange in an interesting kind of way.  Excellent merge of the faces and a truly unique idea.  A family member could really appreciate this.  I think the one thing that might have improved it is a different (brighter, more colorful) background and a more colorful shirt.  It comes across as lacking ummmph and for me I think it is the color rather than the processing because everything is sharp and well focused with good contrast.', '2009-10-22 09:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696989, 828825, 76598, '<td valign="top">This is a unique idea and you did a wonderful job catching men at their "work".  To my mind the thing that would improve this set would be the cleanness of the images.  The top one is perfect, but the bottom two have more natural contrast and messy backgrounds which distract from the image....maybe a shallower depth of field would have helped those bottom two images.</td>', 'This is a unique idea and you did a wonderful job catching men at their "work".  To my mind the thing that would improve this set would be the cleanness of the images.  The top one is perfect, but the bottom two have more natural contrast and messy backgrounds which distract from the image....maybe a shallower depth of field would have helped those bottom two images.', '2009-10-22 10:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5696994, 828747, 76598, '<td valign="top">Very nice, good color and mixture of subjects.  To my eye, the main (top) image lacks a focal point and doesn''t draw me in like the lower two.</td>', 'Very nice, good color and mixture of subjects.  To my eye, the main (top) image lacks a focal point and doesn''t draw me in like the lower two.', '2009-10-22 10:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5697024, 827799, 109389, '<td valign="top">I love this. Beautiful specimen :)</td>', 'I love this. Beautiful specimen :)', '2009-10-22 10:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5697041, 828632, 110909, '<td valign="top">cute kid :)</td>', 'cute kid :)', '2009-10-22 10:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5697043, 827994, 110909, '<td valign="top">lol</td>', 'lol', '2009-10-22 10:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5697044, 828384, 30049, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning piece of work here!  Well thought out story line with wonderful imagery to put it together.  <img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30049/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_763011.gif'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30049/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_763011.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/30049/800/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_763011.gif"/> <br/> <br/>I look forward to seeing this on the front page with a shiny new blue ribbon at rollover!</td>', 'Absolutely stunning piece of work here!  Well thought out story line with wonderful imagery to put it together.    I look forward to seeing this on the front page with a shiny new blue ribbon at rollover!', '2009-10-22 10:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5697045, 828240, 30049, '<td valign="top">Absolutely one of the better Triptych''s I''ve seen.  Wonderful job of putting together a storyboard with photos!  See you on the front page at rollover.  :-)  Had voted earlier (I was stubborn and gave it a 9)...bumping to 10.  Well done!</td>', 'Absolutely one of the better Triptych''s I''ve seen.  Wonderful job of putting together a storyboard with photos!  See you on the front page at rollover.  :-)  Had voted earlier (I was stubborn and gave it a 9)...bumping to 10.  Well done!', '2009-10-22 10:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5697047, 828722, 110909, '<td valign="top">cool!  one of my favorites so far.  :)</td>', 'cool!  one of my favorites so far.  :)', '2009-10-22 10:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5697050, 828452, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice photo by itself, but doesn''t feel like a Triptych.  Seems more like a regular photo with just lines/frames put over it.</td>', 'Nice photo by itself, but doesn''t feel like a Triptych.  Seems more like a regular photo with just lines/frames put over it.', '2009-10-22 10:50:53.000000', NULL, 1),
