(5698671, 828150, 69246, '<td valign="top">This image looks a little out of focus, color seems off, and it looks as though there is some issue with the lens. In other words, this is a fantastic capture. The items and pose of the woman speaks "modern". How you achieved this look with contemporary equipment is a tribute. Nicely done. I hope others share this point of view.</td>', 'This image looks a little out of focus, color seems off, and it looks as though there is some issue with the lens. In other words, this is a fantastic capture. The items and pose of the woman speaks "modern". How you achieved this look with contemporary equipment is a tribute. Nicely done. I hope others share this point of view.', '2009-10-23 21:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
