(5698938, 828471, 77149, '<td valign="top">Nice...there''re a few similar entries in terms of concepts, but this is by far the most balanced, competent and interesting. Straight onto the favourites list...</td>', 'Nice...there''re a few similar entries in terms of concepts, but this is by far the most balanced, competent and interesting. Straight onto the favourites list...', '2009-10-24 04:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5698939, 827799, 77149, '<td valign="top">Very nice - and a better DOF than I would''ve expected on such a long creature. Was it a case of "in the freezer" with your model? :-)</td>', 'Very nice - and a better DOF than I would''ve expected on such a long creature. Was it a case of "in the freezer" with your model? :-)', '2009-10-24 04:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5698941, 828782, 77149, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful colours...and a good use of the triptych license, even down to the opposed curves of the spines on the two edge panels. Also, it''s nicer that you didn''t just use the same leaf and ''shop the colours. Good luck!</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful colours...and a good use of the triptych license, even down to the opposed curves of the spines on the two edge panels. Also, it''s nicer that you didn''t just use the same leaf and ''shop the colours. Good luck!', '2009-10-24 04:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5698943, 828814, 77149, '<td valign="top">Very beautifully done, from the composition to the focus. I think the red''s a little bright on the middle panel, but the important thing is that the terracotta matches across all three. Good luck!</td>', 'Very beautifully done, from the composition to the focus. I think the red''s a little bright on the middle panel, but the important thing is that the terracotta matches across all three. Good luck!', '2009-10-24 04:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5698944, 828619, 77149, '<td valign="top">Sweet use of the triptych mandate - I like the idea. I don''t know if it could be more balanced (in terms of the lines of the steps and lintel), or if that would''ve looked worse? Good luck!</td>', 'Sweet use of the triptych mandate - I like the idea. I don''t know if it could be more balanced (in terms of the lines of the steps and lintel), or if that would''ve looked worse? Good luck!', '2009-10-24 04:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5698945, 827994, 77149, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  I like the humour very much - cheers!  Shame about the reflections off the "top" pair of feet in the second frame, but the action blur is nicely suggestive!  Expect 9s-10s from the foot-fetish crowd  ;-)</td>', 'Awesome!  I like the humour very much - cheers!  Shame about the reflections off the "top" pair of feet in the second frame, but the action blur is nicely suggestive!  Expect 9s-10s from the foot-fetish crowd  ;-)', '2009-10-24 04:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5698949, 828199, 77149, '<td valign="top">Great idea, and well executed. Just sad that the left panel can''t be brightened up a little to compete with the middle panel. Good luck!</td>', 'Great idea, and well executed. Just sad that the left panel can''t be brightened up a little to compete with the middle panel. Good luck!', '2009-10-24 04:34:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5698950, 828701, 77149, '<td valign="top">Nice innovation of the triptych - and a sweet bike, of course! I''d like to have seen both the internal panels b&amp;w - just to see which way works best. Good luck!</td>', 'Nice innovation of the triptych - and a sweet bike, of course! I''d like to have seen both the internal panels b&w - just to see which way works best. Good luck!', '2009-10-24 04:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5698951, 827981, 77149, '<td valign="top">Good story, but I think the borders on the two lower panels should have been thicker, in order to separate them from the similar colours of the main panel.</td>', 'Good story, but I think the borders on the two lower panels should have been thicker, in order to separate them from the similar colours of the main panel.', '2009-10-24 04:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5698953, 828823, 77149, '<td valign="top">I really really like the idea - I just wish the focus on the main panel was tighter on the silos (or is it an unavoidable function of the crop dust, making it look noisy?). Then again, my girlfriend prefers it the way it is, so of course I now think that I do too  ;-)</td>', 'I really really like the idea - I just wish the focus on the main panel was tighter on the silos (or is it an unavoidable function of the crop dust, making it look noisy?). Then again, my girlfriend prefers it the way it is, so of course I now think that I do too  ;-)', '2009-10-24 04:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5698963, 828457, 77149, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the composition, but I think the colour casts make the entry look too faded.</td>', 'I like the idea and the composition, but I think the colour casts make the entry look too faded.', '2009-10-24 05:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5698967, 828747, 77149, '<td valign="top">Generally nice, but i would have put the larger frame at the bottom, makes it easier for the viewer. In fact, i would have changed it to keep the colour scheme in line because the green in the top frame is quite strong.  Having said that, i really like the bottom two pictures. Nice perspective...</td>', 'Generally nice, but i would have put the larger frame at the bottom, makes it easier for the viewer. In fact, i would have changed it to keep the colour scheme in line because the green in the top frame is quite strong.  Having said that, i really like the bottom two pictures. Nice perspective...', '2009-10-24 05:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
