(5699650, 828240, 102278, '<td valign="top">Fantastic evocative image. I can almost smell the place! Wonderful main shot and the two detail images are perfect. Great b/w processing as well.  My choice for the blue. 10.</td>', 'Fantastic evocative image. I can almost smell the place! Wonderful main shot and the two detail images are perfect. Great b/w processing as well.  My choice for the blue. 10.', '2009-10-25 08:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
