(5699654, 828719, 102278, '<td valign="top">I love this tryptych. Wonderful sense of abandonment and isolation. Reminds me of a J.G Ballard story. Each image works perfectly together with the blurred part of the central image cleverly giving us a voyeuristic feel. In my top three images of the challenge. 9.</td>', 'I love this tryptych. Wonderful sense of abandonment and isolation. Reminds me of a J.G Ballard story. Each image works perfectly together with the blurred part of the central image cleverly giving us a voyeuristic feel. In my top three images of the challenge. 9.', '2009-10-25 08:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5699655, 828501, 102278, '<td valign="top">Beautiful triptych. Wonderful soft focus and colour. This my favourite out of all the flower/plant triptychs in the challenge and in my top 5. 9.</td>', 'Beautiful triptych. Wonderful soft focus and colour. This my favourite out of all the flower/plant triptychs in the challenge and in my top 5. 9.', '2009-10-25 08:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
