(5699969, 827951, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh - beautiful! The mix of warm and cool tones work so well.  This is fall at its best.</td>', 'Oh - beautiful! The mix of warm and cool tones work so well.  This is fall at its best.', '2009-10-25 19:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
