(5700022, 828471, 93756, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot of the sunset. Nice color in the grasses. But photos of photographers are never really nice to look at IMO.</td>', 'Beautiful shot of the sunset. Nice color in the grasses. But photos of photographers are never really nice to look at IMO.', '2009-10-25 20:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
