(5700025, 828492, 93756, '<td valign="top">This is great! I like the dark tones. Only nitpick is in the first frame, there are plants in the front of the frame that aren''t there in the other two because you zoomed. I think it looks cleaner without the stuff in the front.</td>', 'This is great! I like the dark tones. Only nitpick is in the first frame, there are plants in the front of the frame that aren''t there in the other two because you zoomed. I think it looks cleaner without the stuff in the front.', '2009-10-25 20:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
