(5700030, 828820, 93756, '<td valign="top">Wow squirrel photo! Would love to see that one on its own. I mean, wow!  Such a common subject and you''ve taken a terrific photo. The misty lake is nice but the deer photo seems cut off and overexposed so that one doesn''t help your triptych.</td>', 'Wow squirrel photo! Would love to see that one on its own. I mean, wow!  Such a common subject and you''ve taken a terrific photo. The misty lake is nice but the deer photo seems cut off and overexposed so that one doesn''t help your triptych.', '2009-10-25 20:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
