(5701753, 828808, 108580, '<td valign="top">Somewhat clichéd but still a nice triptych. Lighting is good and not too harsh, especially at this time of year so it''s representative of the season. A little OOF.</td>', 'Somewhat clichéd but still a nice triptych. Lighting is good and not too harsh, especially at this time of year so it''s representative of the season. A little OOF.', '2009-10-27 04:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
