(5701755, 828676, 108580, '<td valign="top">A great story being told here. The B&amp;W on right clearly depicts contemplative the end of the road when compared to the bright fun booze bottle on the left. Well thought out and executed. A striped shirt on the ''prisoner'' ala Beagle Boys would have scored one point more :) Hopefully your son inherits all your gear if you end up in the slammer :)</td>', 'A great story being told here. The B&W on right clearly depicts contemplative the end of the road when compared to the bright fun booze bottle on the left. Well thought out and executed. A striped shirt on the ''prisoner'' ala Beagle Boys would have scored one point more :) Hopefully your son inherits all your gear if you end up in the slammer :)', '2009-10-27 04:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
