(5703608, 828717, 67152, '<td valign="top">A cool shot and well done photo.<br/> <br/>But on one thing you said in your photo comments. <br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=18563" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">todbedy</a> said "They said I used a selection tool but I honestly don''t remember doing this. To make the border in the middle I just used the line tool and erased the border where I didn''t want it. Oh well, next time!"<br/> <br/>Using an eraser is a selection tool.</td>', 'A cool shot and well done photo. But on one thing you said in your photo comments.   todbedy said "They said I used a selection tool but I honestly don''t remember doing this. To make the border in the middle I just used the line tool and erased the border where I didn''t want it. Oh well, next time!" Using an eraser is a selection tool.', '2009-10-28 07:26:12.000000', NULL, 0),
