(5704069, 828442, 83313, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 6. It is good, and the lighting is good as well, but it did not connect with me in any way or make me go "wow". When looking at the larger pane on the left, my attention is drawn not to the woman looking at the snowglobe, but to the strings of lights hanging from the window. I was also speed voting, as I wanted to vote this challenge, but only had about 20 minutes after I got my entry for the new challenge uploaded. That didn''t give me time to examine each image for subtleties.</td>', 'I gave it a 6. It is good, and the lighting is good as well, but it did not connect with me in any way or make me go "wow". When looking at the larger pane on the left, my attention is drawn not to the woman looking at the snowglobe, but to the strings of lights hanging from the window. I was also speed voting, as I wanted to vote this challenge, but only had about 20 minutes after I got my entry for the new challenge uploaded. That didn''t give me time to examine each image for subtleties.', '2009-10-28 12:50:55.000000', NULL, 0),
