(5704433, 828754, 108580, '<td valign="top">You were robbed. Landscapes and studio work is relatively easy compared with unco-operative bugs. I have favourited you as I''m gonna get this good one day (checked your portfolio). No point in my 180mm Sigma APO f/3.5 1:1 HSM blah blah and not using it...I personally like the abstract side of nature, like a closeup of the fur, the bug, the leaf, the grains of sand as you''ve done.</td>', 'You were robbed. Landscapes and studio work is relatively easy compared with unco-operative bugs. I have favourited you as I''m gonna get this good one day (checked your portfolio). No point in my 180mm Sigma APO f/3.5 1:1 HSM blah blah and not using it...I personally like the abstract side of nature, like a closeup of the fur, the bug, the leaf, the grains of sand as you''ve done.', '2009-10-28 16:47:24.000000', NULL, 0),
