(5705333, 828150, 70265, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... I really don''t get why this did not score much higher. DPC sometimes misses the boat when scoring the more artistic shots. I am looking at the contest entries for the first time ... this one just does not belong at number 64. No where near I think. I just love the colors, composition, overall warm feel. Your use of the black border is right on IMO. Outstanding work!</td>', 'Hmmm... I really don''t get why this did not score much higher. DPC sometimes misses the boat when scoring the more artistic shots. I am looking at the contest entries for the first time ... this one just does not belong at number 64. No where near I think. I just love the colors, composition, overall warm feel. Your use of the black border is right on IMO. Outstanding work!', '2009-10-29 10:33:52.000000', NULL, 0),
