(5707434, 828681, 87278, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by The Eskimo:</b></div><hr/><i> Terrific lighting and exposure as usual.  Is that a marble sitting in shallow water?  I gave this one a 9. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Now that you mention, I guess so. Canica, is marble in Spanish, per Google.</td>', 'Originally posted by The Eskimo: Terrific lighting and exposure as usual.  Is that a marble sitting in shallow water?  I gave this one a 9.   Now that you mention, I guess so. Canica, is marble in Spanish, per Google.', '2009-10-31 15:21:57.000000', NULL, 0),
