(5745861, 827994, 66635, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious!  It reminds me of a water color my wife and I have on the wall entitled "Menage a Trois."  The artist painted a bed from the same perspective as this photo with two pairs of feet pointing up as in the third of your three photos and the face of a Labrador Retriever peeking out from under the sheets between the two pairs of feet and facing the artist/viewer.  I''ve wanted to submit a photo version of that painting for years but have never done it.  Really nice.  I will comment, however, that it is unfortunate that in picture #2, only one set of feet are moving!</td>', 'This is hilarious!  It reminds me of a water color my wife and I have on the wall entitled "Menage a Trois."  The artist painted a bed from the same perspective as this photo with two pairs of feet pointing up as in the third of your three photos and the face of a Labrador Retriever peeking out from under the sheets between the two pairs of feet and facing the artist/viewer.  I''ve wanted to submit a photo version of that painting for years but have never done it.  Really nice.  I will comment, however, that it is unfortunate that in picture #2, only one set of feet are moving!', '2009-11-29 18:35:35.000000', NULL, 0),
